description	"Commander Bly

A high-mobility ARC Commander equipped with heavy, slow-firing precision blasters and felucian hazard gear.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Dual Vibro-Shivs (Dual Style Saber)
-- No Saber/Blaster Defense
-- No Blaster Deflect
-- Cripples/Poisons On Hit
- Heavy DC-17 Dual Pistols (3)
-- Mandalorian Pistols
-- 45% Slower RoF
-- 60% More Damage
-- 20% Faster Velocity
-- Mag Reload
- Scoped DC-15A Heavy Rifle (3)
-- EE4
-- 65% More Damage
-- 50% Slower RoF
-- 25% Faster Velocity
-- Mag Reload
- Frag Grenades (2)
- Smoke Grenades (2)
-- Concussion Grenade
-- 0 Damage, Smoke Screen On Detonation
- Fire Grenades (2)

^8Attributes:
- Rally
- Blast Armor
- Environment Protection (2)
- Dexterity (3)
- Dodge (2)
- Knockdown Roll
- Aerial Stamina Regen
- Grapple Hop
- Healing (2)
- Stamina (3)
- Grappling Hook (3)
- Bunny Hop (0)
- Slow Faller
- Tracking Beacon

^3Abilities:
- Dodge (2) ^3[CS1]
- Sprint (3) ^3[CS2]
- Dex Roll ^3[CS3]
- Gunkick ^3[CS4]
- Felucian Poison Dart (6) ^3[Melee CS3]
-- Cripples/Tracks On Hit
-- 100% More Damage
- Grapple Hook (3) ^3[Melee CS4]"